      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5291 - In the narration of Al-Sakooni, it is reported that Commander of the Faithful (as) ruled that if the spine is broken, the full blood money (diya) is due."
        ]
      }
